DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ggrroouuppaadddd utility adds a group to the system.  The options are as fol‐
     lows:

     --gg _g_i_d  Gives the numeric group identifier to be used for the new group.

     --oo      Allows the new group to have a GID which is already in use for
             another group.

     --vv      Enables verbose mode - explain the commands as they are executed.

EEXXIITT SSTTAATTUUSS
     The ggrroouuppaadddd utility exits 0 on success, and >0 if an error occurs.

